WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.505
Deliberate practice starts with a clear skill definition.

2
00:00:03.505 --> 00:00:16.209
A vague ambition like get better is not enough because it does not say what to practice, how to practice it, or how to know whether progress is happening.

3
00:00:16.209 --> 00:00:28.038
A clearer target might be identifying root cause from log evidence, writing concise executive summaries, asking better diagnostic questions, or explaining technical risk to a nontechnical audience.

4
00:00:28.038 --> 00:00:31.980
Complex work usually needs to be broken into subskills.

5
00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:39.866
Troubleshooting, for example, may include forming hypotheses, collecting evidence, testing assumptions, communicating status, and deciding when to escalate.

6
00:00:39.866 --> 00:00:47.752
Writing may include organizing ideas, choosing the right level of detail, making claims precise, and revising for clarity.

7
00:00:47.752 --> 00:00:53.885
Skill decomposition turns a broad capability into smaller parts that can actually be practiced.

8
00:00:53.885 --> 00:00:56.951
Observable behaviors make practice easier to design.

9
00:00:56.951 --> 00:01:06.589
If the goal is better incident handoffs, the behavior might be summarizing impact, current hypothesis, evidence gathered, decisions made, and next action.

10
00:01:06.589 --> 00:01:15.789
If the goal is better code review, the behavior might be identifying the security-relevant data flow before commenting on style.

11
00:01:15.789 --> 00:01:19.732
Good success criteria describe what strong performance looks like.

12
00:01:19.732 --> 00:01:23.675
Choosing one improvement target at a time protects focus.

13
00:01:23.675 --> 00:01:30.684
If a learner tries to improve everything at once, feedback becomes noisy and cognitive load rises.

14
00:01:30.684 --> 00:01:35.065
Start with the bottleneck that most limits real-world performance.

15
00:01:35.065 --> 00:01:40.322
Practice it deliberately, measure the change, then move to the next subskill.

16
00:01:40.322 --> 00:01:46.455
This keeps practice connected to capability instead of becoming a collection of disconnected exercises.
